      "lines": [
        "从数列的某一项起，通过前面的项（一项或几项）表示数",
        "列任何一项的公式叫做递推公式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在给出数列的递推法中，通常指出："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "а) 数列的第1项（或前几项），"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "б) 根据已知的前面的项能够确定数列的任何一项的公",
        "式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下面，我们再举出一些用递推法给出数列的例子."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例1 假设数列$(c_n)$的第1项等于12，从第2项起，每一",
        "项都是通过从它前面一项减去5得出，也就是说，$c_1=12,c_{n+1}",
        "=c_n-5$. 于是，",
        "$c_2=c_1-5=7$，",
        "$c_3=c_2-5=2$，",
        "$c_4=c_3-5=-3$等等."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2 数列$(d_n)$的第1项等于1，从第2项起，每一项都等于自身",
        "的序号和前一项的积，也就是说，$d_1=1,d_{n+1}=d_n(n+1)$.",
        "于是 $d_2=d_1\\cdot2=1\\cdot2=2$，",
        "$d_3=d_2\\cdot3=1\\cdot2\\cdot3=6$，",
        "$d_4=d_3\\cdot4=1\\cdot2\\cdot3\\cdot4=24$，等等."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在这个数列中，第$n$项等于从1到$n$所有自然数的积. 在数学里，",
        "我们用$n!$（读作“$n$的阶乘”）表示积$1\\cdot2\\cdot3\\cdot\\ldots\\cdot n$. 例如，$1\\cdot2\\cdot3\\cdot4\\cdot5=5!$",
        "利用这个符号，可以把数列$(d_n)$的通项公式写成$d_n=n!$这种形式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "218",
